    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353-a3">

                <pb facs="0546" n="452" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg452"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sandoval to Mr.
                            George.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nogales, Sonora</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-03"><hi rendition="#italic">March 3,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Having been informed that Mr. Manuel
                    Mascarenas has notified our Government that the compromise with you regarding
                    dropping the accusation pending against Deputy Sheriff Roberts and Mr. A.
                    Bachelier for the arrest of Jesus Garcia, if this man was turned over to Mexico,
                    had been made with me as member of the city council, said statement being
                    untrue, as I had no official knowledge whatever of the case, I respectfully
                    request of you to inform me what you know of said affair.</p>
                <p>Yours, respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Sandoval.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
